# Sourced as POSIX shell by lsrc/mkrc/rcdn/rcup -- see rcrc(5). Start from
# thoughtbot's config so their EXCLUDES/DOTFILES_DIRS stay in sync, then add
# ours on top. Duplicating their values here is how CODEOWNERS drifted out.
. "$HOME/dotfiles/rcrc"

# setup/ holds provisioning scripts, not dotfiles -- don't link it to ~/.setup.
# asdfrc is thoughtbot's and meaningless now that we use mise.
EXCLUDES="$EXCLUDES setup asdfrc"
